  "headline": "Rep. Ansari visits Phoenix ICE field office after reports of long holds and medical emergencies",
  "bounded_summary": "KJZZ reported that Rep. Yassamin Ansari made an unannounced oversight visit to ICE's Phoenix field office after Arizona Mirror reporting on prolonged temporary holding and medical-emergency calls. Ansari's office said the reporting described 11 emergency calls from December 2025 through March 2026 and a facility with no on-site medical services, limited food access, and no detainee showers; KJZZ also reported that Ansari said she was not allowed to speak with detainees during the visit.",
